  "question_stem": "The time taken, in minutes, to walk to school was recorded for 200 pupils at a certain school. These times are summarised in the following table.\n\n| Time taken ($t$ minutes) | $t \\leqslant 15$ | $t \\leqslant 25$ | $t \\leqslant 30$ | $t \\leqslant 40$ | $t \\leqslant 50$ | $t \\leqslant 70$ |\n| Cumulative frequency | 18 | 46 | 88 | 140 | 176 | 200 |",
  "context_texts": [
    "A cumulative-frequency curve through $(15,18),(25,46),(30,88),(40,140),(50,176),(70,200)$, joined to $(0,0)$, with correctly labelled axes."
